WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.412
Breathing branch.

00:00:01.412 --> 00:00:06.145
Look for chest rise and fall for no more than 10 seconds.

00:00:06.145 --> 00:00:08.802
Gasping is not normal breathing.

00:00:08.802 --> 00:00:14.199
If breathing is absent or abnormal, or you are unsure, begin CPR.

00:00:14.199 --> 00:00:20.759
If breathing is normal, do not compress; keep monitoring while waiting for EMS.
